WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 line:92%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.502 line:92%
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.636 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm doing well.

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:04.738 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:04.738 --> 00:00:06.039 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.240 align:start size:94% position:6%
According
to The Washington Post,

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden exercises
most mornings

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
by lifting weights
before he begins work.

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:15.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
That makes sense
because he is clearly

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:16.416 line:92%
not using the StairMaster.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:19.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I'm sorry, but the clip is fun

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:20.286 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's fine.

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
According to
The Washington Post,

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:24.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden occasionally
goes to the South Lawn

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
or Rose Garden during the da
to get fresh air

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.395 line:92%
with his dogs, Champ and Major

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:33.033
while the rest of the staf
goes literally anywhere else

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
Somebody commented me
that it's time

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:39.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
to stop making fun
of Major biting people.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.274 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I feel like a year.

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:44.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
He has to go a year
without biting anyone.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:44.844 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:48.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Biden said on Friday
that he would not allow

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:48.915 size:81% position:41% line:92%
the Justice Department

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:51.217 align:start size:94% position:6%
to seize the phone records
of journalists.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, that explains
Matt Gaetz's new hat.

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:57.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
President Biden has reportedly
continued a tradition,

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:59.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
started
by former President Obama,

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:01.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
of reading ten letters
each night

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:04.631
that are sent to the White House
by individual Americans.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.399 line:92%
Though, in the Obama days,

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.568 line:92%
they were mostly from Joe.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.602 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.071 line:92%
Former Vice President Mike Pence

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
and former
Second Lady Karen Pence

00:01:12.272 --> 00:01:15.708
have reportedly purchased a ne
home outside of Indianapolis

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, of course,
it was outside the city

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:21.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
because you know this guy
doesn't go downtown.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.950 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.951 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Baze!

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:27.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
Alex Baze,
as I live and breathe!

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:28.888 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:31.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
A New York librarian
was arrested last Friday

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:33.359 line:92%
for allegedly robbing a bank

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.195 line:92%
Well, trying to, at least.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:37.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Whispering ]
Okay, everyone hit the floor

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:38.798 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.534 size:81% position:41%
Because they'd whisper
outside the library.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.735 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:43.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's the thing
about librarians.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
People think it's
about the library.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:48.842 line:92%
It's fundamentally inside them

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:51.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was announced last week
that Pope Francis

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
will get a new
electric Popemobile.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.416
Of course, before he can plu
the charger into the outlet,

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:57.951 line:92%
they have to get married.

00:01:57.951 --> 00:01:59.319 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:02.388
According to a new study,
dogs can effectively detec

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:05.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
the coronavirus
with 97% accuracy,

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:06.292 line:92%
which is great news becaus

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's the only provider
in your network.

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:12.232
Scientists reported that the
largest iceberg in the world

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:13.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
broke off from Antarctica
last week

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:17.137
and it's roughly 70 times
larger than Manhattan.

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:20.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, but I bet they don't hav
any good restaurants.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:23.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, finally, yesterday wa
Lucky Penny Day.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:27.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right, because who's luckier
than Abraham Lincoln?

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:29.015 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:32.519
Look, I don't have to read
the Mike Scollins jokes.

00:02:32.519 --> 00:02:34.554 align:start size:94% position:6%
I get that.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.554 --> 00:02:37.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, if I didn't,
you wouldn't know

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:40.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
what I'm putting up with,
day in and day out.

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:42.028 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:44.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
"If you see something,
say something."

00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:47.901
[ Laughter ]
That was a monologue, everybody.

